msgid "Cut, count and clean versions with loops, `break` and `continue`"
msgstr "Изрязване, броене и почистване на версии с loops, `break` и `continue`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1429
msgid "`\\|\\|` or `??` - show missing values without losing `0` and `false`"
msgstr "`\\|\\|` или `??` - показване на липсващи стойности, без да се губят `0` и `false`"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1431
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Обобщение"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1433
msgid "Topic"
msgstr "Тема"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1433
msgid "Remember"
msgstr "Запомнете"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1435
msgid "Comparisons"
msgstr "Сравнения"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1435
msgid "Always a boolean. Use `===` / `!==`; `== null` only for \"null or undefined\""
msgstr "Винаги boolean. Използвайте `===` / `!==`; `== null` само за \"null или undefined\""

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1436
msgid "Strings"
msgstr "Strings"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1436
msgid "Compared character by character: `\"4.10\" < \"4.2\"` is `true`. Compare versions part by part"
msgstr "Сравняват се символ по символ: `\"4.10\" < \"4.2\"` е `true`. Сравнявайте версиите част по част"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1437
msgid "Logic"
msgstr "Логика"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1437
msgid "`&&`, `\\|\\|`, `!`; parentheses when mixing; `!(a && b)` is `!a \\|\\| !b`"
msgstr "`&&`, `\\|\\|`, `!`; скоби при смесване; `!(a && b)` е `!a \\|\\| !b`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1438
msgid "Truthy / falsy"
msgstr "Truthy / falsy"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1438
msgid "Falsy: `false`, `0`, `NaN`, `\"\"`, `null`, `undefined`. `\"no\"` and `\"0\"` are truthy"
msgstr "Falsy: `false`, `0`, `NaN`, `\"\"`, `null`, `undefined`. `\"no\"` и `\"0\"` са truthy"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1439
msgid "Defaults"
msgstr "Стойности по подразбиране"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1439
msgid "`a \\|\\| b` replaces every falsy value; `a ?? b` only `null` / `undefined`"
msgstr "`a \\|\\| b` заменя всяка falsy стойност; `a ?? b` - само `null` / `undefined`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1440
msgid "Strictest condition first; only the first match runs; guard clauses with `return`"
msgstr "Първо най-строгото условие; изпълнява се само първото съвпадение; guard clauses с `return`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1441
msgid "One value, `===`, `break` after each case, `default` last"
msgstr "Една стойност, `===`, `break` след всеки case, `default` накрая"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1442
msgid "Ternary"
msgstr "Тернарен оператор"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1442
msgid "`cond ? a : b` returns a value; one level only"
msgstr "`cond ? a : b` връща стойност; само едно ниво"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1443
msgid "Loops"
msgstr "Loops"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1443
msgid "`for` when the count is known, `while` when not, `do...while` at least once"
msgstr "`for`, когато броят е известен, `while`, когато не е, `do...while` - поне веднъж"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1444
msgid "Leave the loop / skip to the next round"
msgstr "Излизане от loop-а / прескачане към следващия кръг"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1445
msgid "Old style"
msgstr "Стар стил"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/03-conditions-and-loops.md:1445
msgid "`var`, `== false`, `indexOf(...) !== -1`, `a && a.b` - read it, write the modern form"
msgstr "`var`, `== false`, `indexOf(...) !== -1`, `a && a.b` - четете го, пишете модерната форма"

